WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.853 --> 00:00:02.651
(slapping noise)

00:00:02.651 --> 00:00:04.352
(swinging hinge noise)

00:00:04.352 --> 00:00:09.067
(upbeat music)

00:00:20.542 --> 00:00:22.371
(bell rings)

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.996
- Do I put it upside
down to dip just the...

00:00:25.996 --> 00:00:28.158
- [Voiceover} yeah
- will it fall off?

00:00:28.158 --> 00:00:30.433
- Dip only the fish part into the sauce.

00:00:30.433 --> 00:00:32.081
- Okay, and I put the
whole thing into my mouth?

00:00:32.081 --> 00:00:34.461
- Oh, this feels so sexual already.

00:00:36.201 --> 00:00:37.178
- Ummm

00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:39.837
- It's delicious, no matter what you do.

00:00:39.837 --> 00:00:41.277
- (laughs)

00:00:41.277 --> 00:00:43.436
- Zero percent different
from how I usually eat sushi.

00:00:43.436 --> 00:00:44.910
- It's fun to eat things
with your hands though.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.616
- And putting the fish right on my tongue,

00:00:46.616 --> 00:00:48.474
kind of enhance the taste experience,

00:00:48.474 --> 00:00:50.437
because it was straight to the taste buds.

00:00:50.437 --> 00:00:51.597
- When you put it in rice first,

00:00:51.597 --> 00:00:54.196
the rice bits are gonna fall down,

00:00:54.196 --> 00:00:56.078
and so you'll just be picking
them out of the soy sauce.

00:00:56.078 --> 00:00:58.610
- Dip control is important
in sushi. (laughs)

00:00:58.610 --> 00:01:02.145
(upbeat music)

00:01:06.271 --> 00:01:07.293
- How are you supposed to eat ginger,

00:01:07.293 --> 00:01:08.615
is there a certain way?

00:01:08.615 --> 00:01:10.565
- [Voiceover] No
- Like upside down? (laughter)

